    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Stylish apartment living in a location that keeps you connected.\r\n\r\nNo. 15 Summerseat Green is a stylish two-bedroom, two-bathroom ground floor apartment in Clonee, with a modern finish and a layout that flows from one space to the next.\r\n\r\nThe main living area is the heart of the apartment. Living, dining and kitchen space connect well, creating an open feel that works for day-to-day life and gives the apartment a strong sense of space.\r\n\r\nBoth bedrooms are well proportioned, with two bathrooms adding another layer of comfort and function. Being on the ground floor is another plus, keeping everything on one level and making the home easy to live in.\r\n\r\nThe location is a big part of the appeal.\r\n\r\nClonee village is close by for shops, cafés and everyday needs, while Blanchardstown is within easy reach for shopping, dining and a wide range of services. Access to both the M3 and M50 puts Dublin and the wider road network within easy reach.\r\n\r\nFor first-time buyers, downsizers or anyone looking for a stylish apartment with strong transport links, No. 15 Summerseat Green makes a lot of sense.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n\r\n• Stylish two-bedroom ground floor apartment\r\n• Two bathrooms\r\n• Flowing kitchen, dining and living space\r\n• Modern interiors throughout\r\n• Accommodation all on one level\r\n• Close to Clonee village\r\n• Easy access to Blanchardstown\r\n• Strong links to the M3 and M50\r\n• Well connected to Dublin"
      },
      {
